
Just some sorting examples.


To generate a list of SHA512 hashs for every file in a 
directory structure do : 

/usr/bin/nice -n +15 find . -type f -exec /opt/schily/bin/mdigest -a sha512 {} \; 

However one may replace mdigest with some other similar sha512 
hash tool : 

/usr/bin/nice -n +15 find . -type f -exec openssl dgst -sha512 -r {} \;

